#====================================================================
# Draft: CMake tests registered in a subdirectory with EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL
#        executables (libcorrect 0.0-git20260204): root-level ctest
#        reports "No tests were found" and plain `cmake --build` never
#        compiles the runners — build the aggregate target explicitly
#        and run ctest from the subdirectory.
#====================================================================

id:                     E760
trigger_tool:           cmake|ctest|conan
phase:                  testing
error_signature:        No tests were found!!!|test_runners EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL|enable_testing.*subdirectory|add_test.*not registered at root

severity:               3
category:               cmake, testing, ci-gate
match_keywords:         ctest, No tests were found, EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL, test_runners, enable_testing, add_subdirectory, tests/CMakeLists.txt, CTestTestfile.cmake, aggregate target, LastTest.log, ctest_entries

title:                  上游把 enable_testing() 放在 tests/ 子目录、且测试可执行文件全部 EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL 时（libcorrect 模式），根目录 `ctest` 报 "No tests were found"、默认构建也不产 runner——须显式构建上游聚合目标（如 test_runners）再进子目录跑 ctest，计数仍以子目录 LastTest.log 为唯一来源

root_cause:             CMake 的测试注册是按目录的：enable_testing() 写在哪个目录的 CMakeLists.txt，CTestTestfile.cmake 就生成在哪个目录（含其子目录），顶层没有该文件时根级 ctest 扫不到任何条目，输出 "No tests were found!!!" 并以退出码 0 结束（假绿）。同时此类项目的测试可执行文件通常声明为 EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL（libcorrect tests/CMakeLists.txt 每个 add_executable 均如此），默认 cmake --build 根本不编译它们，只有上游提供的聚合目标（add_custom_target(test_runners DEPENDS ...)，即上游 make check 的入口）才会构建。两件事叠加：只做其一，要么 runner 不存在，要么 ctest 假绿。
affected_scope:         所有 enable_testing() 不在顶层、测试 runner EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL 的 CMake 项目（libcorrect 0.0-git20260204 实证；上游 GitHub README 推荐 `make check` 的项目多为该形态）。conan 配方里直接 self.run("ctest", cwd=self.build_folder) 的写法会中招。
verification_cmd:       grep -n "enable_testing" CMakeLists.txt tests/CMakeLists.txt; grep -n "EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL" tests/CMakeLists.txt; grep -n "add_custom_target(test" tests/CMakeLists.txt; ctest 2>&1 | grep "No tests"

rec_priority:           3
rec_approach:           build-aggregate-target-then-ctest-in-subdir
rec_description:        (1) 先 grep 三样东西：enable_testing() 的位置（顶层 vs tests/ 子目录）、测试 add_executable 是否带 EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL、是否存在 add_custom_target 聚合目标（test_runners / check 之类）；(2) 配方 build() 里 cmake.build() 之后显式 cmake.build(target="<聚合目标>")——这是上游自己 `make check` 的等价物，不引入任何测试代码改动；(3) ctest 的工作目录选含 CTestTestfile.cmake 的目录（通常 build/tests/），逐候选探测 os.path.isfile(join(dir, "CTestTestfile.cmake")) 后运行，根目录 "No tests were found" 不可作为通过依据（ctest 该路径退出码为 0，是经典假绿）；(4) 计数唯一来源仍是 ctest 写的 Testing/Temporary/LastTest.log（fail-closed 解析：N/M 分母一致性 + Test Passed/Failed 判决行 + 恒等式自检），不要对 stdout 做正则数数；(5) LastTest.log 要在 build 树里递归找（cmake_layout 单配置在 build/Release，子目录测试再深一层），walk 限深防炸。
rec_command:            cmake --build <build_dir> --target test_runners && (cd <build_dir>/tests && ctest --output-on-failure)
rec_auto_fix:           false

# ═══ 知识协作 (Authorship & Provenance) ═══
